<section class="section" style="padding-top:44px;">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h1 style="font-size:32px;">Kuhusu Soko la Mtandaoni</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px;">Soko la Mtandaoni ni jukwaa la biashara mtandaoni linalowaunganisha wauzaji, wanunuzi, na wasafirishaji katika mfumo mmoja. Wauzaji wanaorodhesha bidhaa zao, wanunuzi wanatafuta na kuwasiliana moja kwa moja na wauzaji, na wasafirishaji waliosajiliwa wanaweza kubeba na kuwasilisha bidhaa.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:20px; margin-top:36px;">Mtiririko kwa Muuzaji</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Jisajili</h4><p>Toa taarifa za duka lako na kitambulisho.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Subiri Idhini</h4><p>Admin anakagua na kuidhinisha ndani ya muda mfupi.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Ongeza Bidhaa</h4><p>Weka bidhaa, bei, na picha (hadi 20 bure).</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Uzai</h4><p>Wanunuzi wanakuwasiliana moja kwa moja kwa simu au chat.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Boresha Unapokua</h4><p>Ongeza kikomo cha bidhaa kwa kuupgrade kiwango chako.</p></div></div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:20px; margin-top:36px;">Aina za Usafirishaji</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Private (Binafsi)</h4><p>Mnunuzi au muuzaji anapanga usafirishaji wake mwenyewe. Jukwaa halihusiki.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Protected</h4><p>Muuzaji anasimamia usafirishaji wake; jukwaa linafuatilia hali.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><div><h4>Public</h4><p>Wasafirishaji waliojisajili kwenye jukwaa wanapewa order na kufuatiliwa kikamilifu.</p></div></div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:20px; margin-top:36px;">Malipo</h2>
    <p>Malipo ya bidhaa yanafanywa moja kwa moja kati ya muuzaji na mnunuzi (M-Pesa, T-Pesa, Airtel Money, Benki, au Cash). Jukwaa halihusiki katika kubeba pesa za wanunuzi — mapato ya jukwaa yanatoka kwa ada za usajili tu.</p>

    <div style="margin-top:40px; text-align:center;">
      <a href="/jisajili/muuzaji" class="btn btn-accent">Anza Sasa — Fungua Duka Bure</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

